# Sourced by every tape: the simulated Jira in the background, logged in, with DEMO (the
# default), OPS and WEB set up. Not recorded.
Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 15
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set CursorBlink false

Hide
Type "source /vhs/docs/tapes/session.sh && jtt_setup" Enter
Sleep 4s
Show
